<%- include('../partials/head', {title: 'Program'}) %>
<%- include('../partials/nav', {current: 'format'}) %>

<main>
  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
        <h1 class="section-title mb-0">Program</h1>
        <span class="badge-tbd">Sunday, 25 October 2026</span>
      </div>
      <p class="lead" style="max-width: 48rem;">
        A full-day, Dagstuhl-style (&ldquo;Barstuhl&rdquo;) workshop: discussion-driven,
        not a paper track. The schedule below reflects the published ISWC 2026 program.
        A Zotero group will be created for collaborative bibliography management.
      </p>

      <div class="table-responsive mb-4" style="max-width: 48rem;">
        <table class="table table-bordered align-middle">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Time</th>
              <th scope="col">Block</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>11:10&ndash;12:00 (60&prime;)</td>
              <td>Welcome + Plenary Pitch Session</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>12:00&ndash;12:50 (50&prime;)</td>
              <td>Breakout Round 1</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>12:50&ndash;14:10</td>
              <td>Conference lunch</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>14:10&ndash;15:00 (50&prime;)</td>
              <td>Breakout Round 2</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>15:00&ndash;15:50 (50&prime;)</td>
              <td>Breakout Round 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>15:50&ndash;16:20 (30&prime;)</td>
              <td>Conference break</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>16:20&ndash;17:00 (40&prime;)</td>
              <td>Synthesis &amp; drafting (groups converge)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>17:00&ndash;18:00 (latest)</td>
              <td>Alignment plenary + wrap-up</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p style="max-width: 48rem;">
        Breakout rounds run across three parallel pillars &mdash; (a) Reference Use Cases,
        (b) Engineering Challenges, (c) Foundational Models (see
        <a href="index.html#research">Research questions</a>) &mdash; with participant
        reshuffling between rounds; each group drafts sections of the community document.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h4 mt-5 mb-3">Attending</h2>
      <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3" style="max-width: 48rem;">
        <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent px-0">
          <strong>Date &amp; room</strong> &mdash; Sunday, 25 October 2026, room
          <strong>Pegaso</strong> (as currently listed on the ISWC program; subject to
          change). See the
          <a href="https://iswc2026.semanticweb.org/#/program/schedule" target="_blank" rel="noopener">official ISWC schedule</a>.
        </li>
        <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent px-0">
          <strong>Venue</strong> &mdash; The Nicolaus Hotel, Bari, the same venue as the
          main ISWC 2026 conference. See the
          <a href="https://iswc2026.semanticweb.org/#/attending/venueandaccomodation" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ISWC venue &amp; accommodation page</a>.
        </li>
        <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent px-0">
          <strong>Registration</strong> &mdash; Attending MKG 2026 requires an ISWC 2026
          registration that includes the pre-conference days (workshops are held on a
          pre-conference day). See the
          <a href="https://iswc2026.semanticweb.org/#/attending/registration" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ISWC registration page</a> for fees and options.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
